//RS /// U14/D-JPK-IMAGE1/D-ENV-IMAGE1: `from:` must be written `system.<name>`
//RS /// (the `.Iso` disk-image tier), `packages.<name>` (a package OCI image), or
//RS /// `env.<name>` (a runnable environment OCI image).
